# ─── TEMPORARY .gitignore ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is a TEMPORARY configuration to push everything to GitHub for review.
# Only test coverage output and error logs are excluded.
# The original full .gitignore will be restored after the review is done.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Testing / Coverage Output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov

# ─── Error & Debug Logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
server/logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
